# Content Engine routing contract

When a task mentions Notion, use the already-connected Notion MCP tools and inspect their schemas before acting. Do not use a Notion webview, browser automation, interactive sign-in, cookies, or credential prompts when MCP is available. If the connected MCP is unavailable or insufficient, record a `GAP` and stop rather than falling back to browser authentication. External Notion mutation remains owner-gated and requires target proof plus readback.
